WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.076 --> 00:00:18.168
Chuck: This must be the zoo.

2
00:00:18.248 --> 00:00:21.290
Dave: It’s the strangest zoo I’ve ever seen.

3
00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:25.653
Chuck: It will be even stranger when we are inside the zoo!

4
00:00:25.673 --> 00:00:28.976
Official Ant: Keep quiet!

5
00:00:31.916 --> 00:00:32.816
Official Ant: Put them in here.

6
00:00:33.437 --> 00:00:34.837
This will keep them quiet.

7
00:00:38.979 --> 00:00:44.982
Dave: Hey, let us out of here.

8
00:00:45.002 --> 00:00:47.703
Chuck: Yeah, let us out.

9
00:00:47.723 --> 00:00:53.865
Official Ant: I think our queen is going to be very pleased.

10
00:00:53.885 --> 00:00:57.327
Chuck: What do you think they will do to us?

11
00:00:57.347 --> 00:00:59.168
Dave: I don’t know.

12
00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:02.301
Chuck: They can’t keep us locked up forever.

13
00:01:02.321 --> 00:01:04.821
Dave: Oh no?

14
00:01:05.542 --> 00:01:07.882
I think they kept him locked up forever.

15
00:01:15.284 --> 00:01:16.285
It’s empty in here.

16
00:01:17.105 --> 00:01:18.465
Where are all the ants?

17
00:01:19.446 --> 00:01:21.246
Brad: I’ve seen ants in an ant farm.

18
00:01:22.006 --> 00:01:23.307
Ants are always busy.

19
00:01:23.327 --> 00:01:27.488
Danny: Wait, I hear something coming.

20
00:01:34.832 --> 00:01:35.833
Tina: It’s some ants.

21
00:01:37.614 --> 00:01:39.675
Ant 1: We’re late.

22
00:01:40.356 --> 00:01:41.537
Everyone has gone to the zoo.

23
00:01:41.597 --> 00:01:43.518
Ant 2: Well, hurry up then.

24
00:01:44.079 --> 00:01:46.500
We want to get a good spot to see the humans.

25
00:01:46.520 --> 00:01:50.363
Brad: They’re talking about the bullies!

26
00:01:50.383 --> 00:01:52.284
Danny: Let’s follow them.

27
00:02:01.711 --> 00:02:03.052
Look at the crowd of ants.

28
00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:06.261
Brad: Now we know why all the tunnels were empty.

29
00:02:06.281 --> 00:02:09.023
Danny: They must be looking at Chuck and Dave.

30
00:02:10.204 --> 00:02:10.624
Tina: Hide!

31
00:02:10.904 --> 00:02:12.185
Some more ants are coming.

32
00:02:16.147 --> 00:02:20.290
Ant: Open the cage.

33
00:02:21.230 --> 00:02:23.011
Let me see the humans.

34
00:02:25.013 --> 00:02:26.573
Chuck: Hey, don’t push.

35
00:02:26.593 --> 00:02:30.516
Queen Ant: I am very pleased!

36
00:02:31.532 --> 00:02:34.014
They appear to be in perfect health.

37
00:02:35.075 --> 00:02:38.058
Queen Ant: Do you think they can be trained to do tricks?

38
00:02:38.619 --> 00:02:45.024
Brad: There are so many of them, and only four of us.

39
00:02:45.044 --> 00:02:47.446
Brad: I don’t like those odds.

40
00:02:48.467 --> 00:02:52.191
Tina: We have one advantage, the element of surprise.

41
00:02:52.211 --> 00:02:54.493
Bello: Do you have a plan, Tina?

42
00:02:54.513 --> 00:02:56.094
Tina: I think so.

43
00:02:56.915 --> 00:02:57.796
Let me explain.

44
00:03:04.876 --> 00:03:06.638
Danny: Over here, you silly ants!

45
00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:10.302
Do you want to see another human?

46
00:03:10.322 --> 00:03:12.044
Queen Ant: Get him!

47
00:03:12.064 --> 00:03:16.389
Chuck Dave: It’s Danny!

48
00:03:16.409 --> 00:03:19.432
Tina: What’s Danny doing?

49
00:03:19.452 --> 00:03:22.296
Brad: It looks like Danny has his own plan.

50
00:03:22.316 --> 00:03:25.740
Bello: Quick, now is our chance to rescue the bullies.

51
00:03:34.072 --> 00:03:36.893
Danny: Have you ants ever seen a human go crazy?

52
00:03:42.356 --> 00:03:42.836
Ant 1: Where is he?

53
00:03:42.856 --> 00:03:45.377
Army Ant 2: I can’t see anything.

54
00:03:45.397 --> 00:03:48.118
Army Ant 3: There he is!

55
00:03:48.158 --> 00:03:51.800
Danny: Let’s go.

56
00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:52.980
We have to hurry!

57
00:04:00.424 --> 00:04:00.904
Keep running!

58
00:04:04.972 --> 00:04:05.734
Dave: There it is!

59
00:04:05.774 --> 00:04:06.716
That’s the way out.

60
00:04:06.736 --> 00:04:10.605
Danny: We did it!

61
00:04:10.846 --> 00:04:11.527
We did it!
